                                        </a>
                                    </div>
                                    """ : ""}
                                    
                                    <div class="log-note">
                                        <p><strong>📋 Build Logs:</strong> Comprehensive build logs are attached to this email for detailed analysis and debugging.</p>
                                    </div>
                                    
                                    <div class="team">
                                        <p><strong>📧 Notification Recipients:</strong></p>
                                        <p>marikannan@hexrfactory.com, vishnu@hexrfactory.com, rithish@hexrfactory.com, jerald@hexrfactory.com, ramkumar@hexrfactory.com</p>
                                        <div class="accent-line"></div>
                                        <p><strong>🛠️ DevOps Team:</strong> For technical support or pipeline issues, please contact the DevOps/QA Team</p>
